rem Digital Root Sums of Factorisations
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=159
rem Sum the maximal digital root sums of
rem the factorisations of every n from 2
rem to Limit - 1

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 1000000

rem Best[m] is the larger of dr(m) and
rem dr(d) + Best[k] over m = k d. Settle
rem k in order so Best[k] is final when
rem it feeds the multiples k d.
N = 0 till Limit array
Dr = (N - 1) mod 9 + 1
Dr 0 = 0
Best = Dr copy
for K in 2 to Limit // 2
  Base = Best K
  for D in 2 to (Limit - 1) // K
    Val = Dr D + Base
    if Val greater Best (K * D)
      Best (K * D) = Val
    end
  end
end
Rest = Best drop 2
Answer = Rest sum
Answer print
